// expect: trap
// In a pattern with a back reference no loop remembers where it failed, so `(a|aa)+` backtracks
// exponentially; the matches found before the bad attempt are reported, then the search traps.
import avin.regex.Regex

main()
    val r = Regex("(a|aa)+$\\1")
    println(r.findFirstIn("aab"))
    for m in Regex("(a|aa)+c\\1|x").findAllIn("x x aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaab")
        println(m)
